import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.SpecialPeriodsThreefoldCanonicalPushforwardLocalIsoLinear

/-!
# Genuine global sheaf isomorphisms from compatible local isomorphisms

Local additive section isomorphisms on an actual open cover, natural
under restriction and agreeing on common subopens, yield an isomorphism
of the genuine sheaves. Both directions are constructed by sheaf gluing
and exactly recover every local isomorphism. Scalar linearity follows
from local linearity and the actual scalar restriction homomorphisms.
-/
